SubNumber=3
;;These objects shall contain the mapping parameters for the SRDOs the device is able to receive or
;;transmit. The type of the SRDO mapping parameter is an array of type UNSIGNED32. The sub-index
;;00h contains the number of valid entries within the mapping array. This half of the number of entries is
;;also the number of the application variables, which shall be received/transmitted with the corresponding
;;SRDO. The sub-indices from 01h to number of entries contain the information about the mapped
;;application variables. The structure and the procedure for the mapping is described in /CiA301/. For
;;changing the SRDO mapping first the SRDO shall be deleted.

